{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":{"eng-name":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)","ara-name":"كتاب الصلاة"}},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":896,"arabicnumber":896,"text":"Rapporté par Al-Bara’ ibn Azib رضي الله عنه : Al-Bara’ nous a décrit la manière de se prosterner. Il a posé ses mains (paumes), s’est appuyé sur ses genoux et a levé ses hanches ; il a dit : « C’est ainsi que le Messager d’Allah ﷺ se prosternait. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":506},"chapter":{"id":160,"ara-name":"باب صِفَةِ السُّجُودِ","eng-name":"The Manner Of Prostration","isFirstHadith":true}}]}